; XRepeat (VRF core): operations on <8 x i32>/<8 x float> (8 f registers from
; f0/f8/f16/f24) and <16 x i32>/<16 x float> (f0/f16) are one instruction on
; the first element + xr.repeat mask, stride, count (count = 7 or 15).

